---
config:
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  securityLevel: strict
  fontFamily: 'Noto Sans CJK SC, sans-serif'
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: 'Noto Sans CJK SC, sans-serif'
    fontSize: 17px
    background: '#ffffff'
    primaryColor: '#EAF3F5'
    primaryTextColor: '#173B47'
    primaryBorderColor: '#6794A0'
    lineColor: '#64828C'
    edgeLabelBackground: '#ffffff'
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    wrappingWidth: 240
    curve: linear
    nodeSpacing: 30
    rankSpacing: 42
    padding: 16
    useMaxWidth: false
---
%% Omnidraw -> local mermaid sub-skill. Route by image meaning and real inputs.
flowchart TD
    A["图意 · 场景 · 受众<br/>输入素材与交付要求"] --> B{"按视觉语义<br/>选择制作路线"}
    B -->|流程 / 关系 / 架构| C["结构图<br/>Mermaid / Draw.io"]
    B -->|插画 / 照片 / 概念| D["图像生成或编辑<br/>当前可用图像工具"]
    B -->|真实数据 / 统计| E["数据图<br/>matplotlib"]
    C --> F["可编辑图源 + 预览<br/>来源 · 题注 · 替代文本"]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G{"图意 / 标签 / 数值<br/>视觉审阅通过？"}
    G -->|否：按问题迭代| B
    G -->|是| H["配图 + 图源 + 预览<br/>独立交付或交文档角色整合"]
    classDef input fill:#EDF4F7,stroke:#6E97A6,color:#173B47;
    classDef maker fill:#E8F3EE,stroke:#64957D,color:#173E2C;
    classDef gate fill:#FBF3DE,stroke:#B29A59,color:#52421D;
    classDef done fill:#DCEEE4,stroke:#4C8467,color:#143E29;
    class A input;
    class C,D,E,F maker;
    class B,G gate;
    class H done;
